{"title":"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b78a45217290c13c8ed9f27298cbc19822736e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{x + 1} = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a781da56b427b77229d41f3dfc6090b045c8ba07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{x + 1} = 64 = 2^{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"119\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The bases are equal to each other and aren't equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c7f6cfce579443f984a01e4ef7de871f50638c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 1 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6f89e0dd57880ddd8e4380f0cad2f03a3c60be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 6 - 1 = \\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"121\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 35/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1261/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.738      1 2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\n100.00%    6.738      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37446:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018065730 and revision id 289390. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}